<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21340] quota: unlock lqe_glbl_data_lock on early return</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21340</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;qmt_clear_lgeg_arr_nu() returned false without mutex_unlock() when qmt_map_lge_idx() failed, leaving the global lqe's lqe_glbl_data_lock held and blocking every later user of that lqe. Not released mutex can lead to a deadlock.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
